		(property "Note" "200 V / 1 A hyperfast (trr 25 ns) rectifier, Nexperia datasheet in docs/datasheets. Steady-state VR = 48 + 5 x 4.2 = 69 V, but open-loop simulation (validation/sim) shows leakage ringing: 200 V breakdown without snubber, 88-97 V with R313/C312 (49 % of rating). A 100 V Schottky was rejected for this reason. Avg 0.1 A, peak ~0.7 A"
